{"code":"244460","name":"올리패스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 2006년 설립된 바이오 신약 연구개발 기업으로 2019년 코스닥에 상장하고, 기술상용화를 위한 전문법인 엑소나를 종속회사로 편입함. OliPass PNA 플랫폼으로 RNA 치료제를 개발 중이며, 특정 exon을 결손시켜 단백질 생성을 조절하는 exon skipping 원천기술을 보유하고 있음. 비마약성 진통제 등 다양한 치료제를 연구하며, 기술수출과 파트너사와의 공동연구를 통해 글로벌 시장 진출을 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":1651.0,"open":1651.0,"high":1651.0,"low":1651.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":1651.0,"ma60":1651.0,"ma120":1651.0,"ma200":1651.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":0.0,"r2_250":0.0,"high52":1651.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":64.2857,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-1.0,"op_margin_q":-8.3333,"op_qoq":94.4444,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":95.6522,"rev_yoy":500.0,"op_trend_4q":32.1569,"fin_period":"202606","roe":null,"debt_ratio":-2259.31,"per":null,"pbr":null,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.0,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"244460","name":"올리패스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_code":"261","secto